e (fix-batch doc amendments plus the sanctioned PRD/tech-arch search-deferral backfill, both still uncommitted). None of these prevent safe closeout.\",\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Proceed to epic closeout: (1) sweep the one stale line in tech-design.md's Flow 2 diagram ('bandTokens: Σ stored' → measured per DD-4); (2) record in team-impl-log.md the EV-04-001 ratification ruling (per fix-batch-001), the fix-batch disposition including the invalid 001-fix-result.json envelope (edits verified landed despite the transport failure), and the M3/M4 quality-half transfer to the inference epic per epic.md Assumptions; (3) commit the working-tree changes — fix-batch doc amendments, comment-only code edits, and the sanctioned PRD AC-4.3 search-deferral backfill in 00-prd.md/01-tech-arch.md — as the epic closeout commit, with the final verify-all PASS (366/366, process suite ran) cited in the closeout record.\"}","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"77af4b8d-fd36-430f-8eea-47bd404bad4c","total_cost_usd":2.518956,"usage":{"input_tokens":2127,"cache_creation_input_tokens":64272,"cache_read_input_tokens":476943,"output_tokens":14680,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":64272,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4766,"cache_read_input_tokens":76840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3254,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3254},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1233,"outputTokens":14,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001303,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-fable-5":{"inputTokens":2127,"outputTokens":14680,"cacheReadInputTokens":476943,"cacheCreationInputTokens":64272,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.517653,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOu